{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip is a very very difficult precicion platformer inspired by the hardest games in gaming, such as Kaizo SMW hacks, like Grand Poo World and Dram World. But also games like &quot;I wanna be the guy&quot; and &quot;super meat boy&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 600 story mode levels, Kip 2 pushes your skills and consistency to its limits.\u00a0<br><br>Finished story mode or are you stuck at a level? more awaits. Older legacy levels from before Story Mode existed are also available, offering even more content for the players who want everything. Some levels may be a bit rough, but feel free to skip some to keep the momentum going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/380d26345352bf074ce45e961bf8ca56.avif?t=1771504850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/380d26345352bf074ce45e961bf8ca56.webp?t=1771504850 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made for the determined</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're an experienced platformer player or just a newbie looking to prove yourself. Kip has it all. As you progress, harder variants unlock, they're optional but are extremely difficult versions of levels made only for the best players/</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/d1f702e21c96c1b0401ce38fb9a5b8a7.avif?t=1771504850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/d1f702e21c96c1b0401ce38fb9a5b8a7.avif?t=1771504850 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision above all</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip features very tight, unforgiving controls that require a lot of accuracy and timing. The learning curve is pretty steep, but with enough patience and persistence, anything is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the game has some quirky hitboxes, this is because the game is entirely built with &quot;Turbowarp&quot;, a faster engine of &quot;Scratch&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No monetization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip is free to play, with no monetization of any kind, even with future updates and DLC, it'll all be free for anyone to enjoy :p</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love pushing your limits, smashing your head to seemingly impossible levels and flexing your kipping skills. Let's Kip it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1771504850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1771504850 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kipping it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844220/1f32b6393b6c8b4d8e40f93fb9e98a4605dbf4f6.jpg"},{"name":"First Fried","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844220/5f5672c0bb9bff1e0201dad3a84cc9e2d882af34.jpg"},{"name":"Packing Order","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844220/9136a83514dc01988a84e3db72fbd9ef58031b55.jpg"},{"name":"Featherweight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844220/9768ef533e46cefe92808bca4cc618396f2bc038.jpg"},{"name":"Scambled Eggs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844220/954a8adb9c96dd9694fb427e5d975d95730b2b3e.jpg"},{"name":"Cluckin' Up",