acy and timing. The learning curve is pretty steep, but with enough patience and persistence, anything is possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the game has some quirky hitboxes, this is because the game is entirely built with &quot;Turbowarp&quot;, a faster engine of &quot;Scratch&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No monetization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kip is free to play, with no monetization of any kind, even with future updates and DLC, it'll all be free for anyone to enjoy :p</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love pushing your limits, smashing your head to seemingly impossible levels and flexing your kipping skills. Let's Kip it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1771504850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/extras_big/ccfd2df519abb52b12617fded6326a94.avif?t=1771504850 width=1560 height=156 /></span></p>","developers":["Maarten"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844220/875d4742e222b103dae5a0e595e44198352b7005/header.jpg?t=1771504850","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-3350 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any 2\u20134 GB Graphics Card or Integrated Graphics (e.g. Mesa / Vulkan compatible)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen